 4. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The Jensen Huang story continues to grow, and even the New York Post joined the party .

 Here are a few more from the weekend:

 Allies of Huang are plotting for him to return to the top spot, apparently seeing an opening for a Sam Altman-style comeback. (Financial Times) Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent was having none of it yesterday, urging Nvidia to hire an outside CEO. (Axios) The New York Times offered a six-byline, comprehensive narrative of the entire saga, going back to last year when the paper asked about Megaspeed. 
 
